@nsobid-AEE8F150DDA1B5A838806E1A5EA6827AD9F3C51E

@flag offset_shift 0x100

// The dynamic resolution of update 1.1.1. Its state is the object at [render_system+0x110] (render_system at guest
// 0xc2f4568). The per-frame update 0x8cc85a4 adds the measured frame time (ns at [render_system+0x158]) and moves the
// level 0..3 (+0x34) up or down. Each level sets the shader parameters 3DBufferWidthScale and 3DBufferHeightScale
// (1.0/1.0, 0.9/0.85, 0.85/0.8, 0.8/0.7).
// The update returns at once, so the level that the mode set stays.
@enabled
00CC35A4 C0035FD6

// The mode selector 0x8cc8888 sets fixed scales for the modes 2 to 7 (0.9/0.85 down to 0.5/0.5, and 0.0009/0.00085 in
// mode 5). Its range check always jumps to the default block (1.0/1.0, level 0).
@enabled
00CC38BC 3F000014
